  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Blended learning, South Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Brainstud B.V. focuses on improving the accessibility and flexibility of education through a user-friendly digital platform. This platform offers trainers the opportunity to offer &apos;blended&apos; education.Many traditional trainers feel the need to make the transition from offline classroom education to a new innovative way of practical education that combines offline and online learning forms. Services that can be provided by Brainstud are the implementation of the platform, guidance for the trainer in the transition, restructuring the learning programmes for the new models and organisation of the examinations.In South Africa, where a large group of young people have no access to the labour market or education, there is a great demand for innovative solutions for more flexible vocational education. The government of South Africa is putting pressure on the private sector to make on-the-job training more accessible in order to provide more young people with job skills. Brainstud&apos;s product fits in well with this. It increases the capacity of trainers and improves the accessibility of education.During the demonstration project, Brainstud wants to demonstrate how you, as a trainer, can make the transition to an alternative form of education in which trainers can take on a much more coaching role and in this way serve larger classes and at the same time offer more personal education.</narrative>
  </description>
